~ start
Guard: Halt! I can't let you pass. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_closed.png]
Guard: I am the Guardian of this castle, I would love to let you  in, but I am struggling with the magical mechanism of this gate... [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_sad.png]
Guard: The gate uses these two magical signals, but I am not sure which one opens it. The colors are too similar for me. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_closed.png]
Guard: And if I interact with the wrong crystal, you will certainly die! 
Guard: It is so frustrating to not being able to do the only job I have to do... [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_sad.png]
: You activate your power, and start to see as he sees. 
Guard: See? I can't tell them apart. Please help me! [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_closed.png] [#activate_shader]  
: Now you can try to help the guard by fixing the code behind the magical mechanism of the gate. [#pan_camera] [#show_debug][#minigame_menu]
: Read more about the problem in the Resonance Codex.
=> END


~ fail_reaction
Guard: Mmm... I still cannot tell which one is which. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_sad.png]
=> END


~ circle
Guard: Ah! Now the two signals are easily distinguishable! [#deactivate_shader] [#show_symbols] [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_circle.png]
Guard: Thank you! I can finally understand the mechanism! [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_circle_happy.png] [#close_minigame] [#open_gate] [#reset_camera]
Guard: Very well! You may enter. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_circle_letting.png]
Guard: I heard that the archivist was worried about something... Maybe you should go and check on her! [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/guardian_circle.png]
=> END


